<title>UK: Hays buys North &amp; South Installations.</title>
<headline>Hays buys North &amp; South Installations.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hays Plc, the business services group, has bought North &amp; South Installations Ltd for an initial cash sum of 4.5 million stg as well as taking on debt of 1.6 million stg.</p>
<p>Hays said it could make further cash payments of up to 2.5 million stg if the acquisition hits certain profit targets in the period after completion to June 30 1999. North and South had net assets of 1.3 million in the year ended December 31 1995. It is a refurbishment and refit services group.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
